                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                        "entry_id": "770b49da-3fb1-385d-8823-073228d9b28d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "drukte die de rust verstoort of de saaiheid verdrijft"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "276f0489-d483-415b-8b36-56ba576c8cd1",
                                "sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                                "text": "Het tweetal sloeg in Bahrein voortvarend de revolutie neer die ruimer opgevat bekend staat als de Arabische Lente van 2011. De koning en zijn zoon hadden niet veel op met reuring; Arabische revoluties zijn lastige, democratische oprispingen die een volk nooit ten goede kunnen komen!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca9c16ca-33ad-4d88-8b99-4a715c4e4b46",
                                "sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                                "text": "\"Bewoners hebben een goede band met de instelling. Zorg en samenleven gaan al lang hand in hand. Die band is nu door deze afschuwelijke gebeurtenis verbroken. Mensen zijn overspoeld door een zoekend leger, zoekende politie, helikopters in de lucht, door vrijwilligers, media. Dat brengt zoveel reuring dat ze onzeker worden. Daar hebben we het vanmiddag over gehad.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2081b362-11a5-4410-a07d-1e35a0fff85f",
                                "sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                                "text": "„Het gaat om de mix. We hebben zo’n 10.000 buitenlandse bezoekers. Dat zijn verzamelaars, handelaren en museummensen. De regionale bezoekers zijn vooral in kunst geïnteresseerd. Maar zij zorgen dat het druk is. Heel belangrijk: voor omzet heb je reuring nodig. Bezoekers die voor een kunstwerk staan te dralen en vragen hoe duur iets is, dat stimuleert de echte verzamelaars. Die vrezen dat een ander er met ‘hun’ kunstwerk vandoor gaat.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "af54ec4f-16fa-4247-ac5e-69a9667d66d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "770b49da-3fb1-385d-8823-073228d9b28d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                        "source_sense_description": "drukte die de rust verstoort of de saaiheid verdrijft",
                        "target_lang_word": "Trubel",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Trubel",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1665f286-4e9a-37c1-93c2-6cd7290b0022",
                                        "entry_id": "09867387-324b-33f0-b98c-fdfc01f6a3c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "geschäftiges Treiben, aufgeregtes Durcheinander"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43b06539-147c-47d7-ad39-b4e3f2484471",
                                                "sense_id": "1665f286-4e9a-37c1-93c2-6cd7290b0022",
                                                "text": "Ich mag diesen ganzen Trubel vor Weihnachten nicht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f77512f4-231b-49ea-bef2-501e9e746b96",
                                                "sense_id": "1665f286-4e9a-37c1-93c2-6cd7290b0022",
                                                "text": "„In Wien war alles größer und aufregender. Frühsommer, Trubel auf den Straßen, Menschen aus dem ganzen Kaiserreich, die Mode der Damen ausgefallener, das Gewand der Herren nobler.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12a28d72-e0fe-4f7c-aeee-899722de579c",
                        "source_entry_id": "770b49da-3fb1-385d-8823-073228d9b28d",
                        "source_sense_id": "a887fc4c-dcc6-3f90-8b15-d5937a0d1278",
                        "source_sense_description": "drukte die de rust verstoort of de saaiheid verdrijft",
                        "target_lang_word": "bustle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bustle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An excited activity; a stir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26b20fba-a7c8-497b-8aee-733746e4e294",
                                                "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                                "text": "In the midſt of all this buſtle, I was ſtruck with the appearance of a large bevy of beauties and women of the firſt fashion, who with all the perfect confidence of good breeding, inſhrined themſelves in the ſeveral temples dedicated to the Cyprian Venus[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83947a97-bb0d-4741-b86a-bfc760fbcb45",
                                                "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                                "text": "we are, perhaps, all the while flattering our natural indolence, which, hating the bustle of the world, and drudgery of business seeks a pretence of reason to give itself a full and uncontrolled indulgence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6681b38a-a822-3b3e-a584-3c40c3358e00",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cover to protect and hide the back panel of a computer or other office machine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9268e8b4-497a-3090-a54e-13bad678d693",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A frame worn underneath a woman's skirt, typically only protruding from the rear as opposed to the earlier more circular hoops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc9a110b-58eb-4fb4-ab23-eda944c5eaed",
                                                "sense_id": "9268e8b4-497a-3090-a54e-13bad678d693",
                                                "text": "All the portraits that hang on the walls of the living room are, I realize, of my mother's family: miniatures of her great-aunts in Victorian bustles and elaborate feathered hats; a gilt-framed oil of her great-great-great-uncle as a boy in pastoral England, wearing a gold riding coat over white jodhpurs and sitting astride a white steed, a King Charles spaniel yapping at them from the foreground of the canvas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bustle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move busily and energetically with fussiness (often followed by about)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c341664-d506-4ea4-8af5-c00eecea49d2",
                                                "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                                "text": "The commuters bustled about inside the train station."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61196184-155b-4e59-ade5-b2baec05a93d",
                                                "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                                "text": "I was once so mad to bussell abroad, and seek about for preferment […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e427dae0-b605-392e-abbf-d4682ebe7455",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To teem or abound (usually followed by with); to exhibit an energetic and active abundance (of a thing)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f874ee3-cdbd-4fbe-8a9f-11767b692fe3",
                                                "sense_id": "e427dae0-b605-392e-abbf-d4682ebe7455",
                                                "text": "The train station was bustling with commuters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d91af679-37f3-3d90-be43-ba54606a8b84",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To push around, to importune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a89d1d-f98f-4597-83bd-203a1b556dbc",
                                                "sense_id": "d91af679-37f3-3d90-be43-ba54606a8b84",
                                                "text": "Don’t bustle her or fuss or snatch: / A suitor looking at his watch / Is not a posture that persuades / Willing, much less reluctant maids."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
